   This file deliberately defaults to ALL RIGHTS RESERVED because the project
   brief does not state a licence, and that choice is REVERSIBLE: rights not
   granted today can be granted tomorrow. The opposite is not true — publishing
   under an open licence cannot be undone, because every recipient keeps the
   rights they were given. When the intended licence is confirmed, replace this
   file wholesale.
