8. NOT A SURVEY OF RECORD

   ★ THIS SOFTWARE IS A SURVEYING AID, NOT A LICENSED SURVEY.

   Coordinates it produces are as accurate as the operator's identification of a
   landmark and the resolution of the underlying imagery. Reported accuracy
   figures (CE90) describe imagery resolution and click precision — they are not
   a guarantee of positional truth and do not account for operator
   misidentification.

   Output must not be relied upon as a survey of record, a cadastral boundary
   determination, or engineering control without independent verification by a
   qualified surveyor.
